- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 11\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to the pursuit of verifiable knowledge and impactful research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 15,232 / 600,000 used (3%)\n- Agent Age: 11 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline\n**ID:** 1\n**Tags:** baseline, mlp, shared-weights, batch-norm, dropout\n**Abstract:** Shared-neuron MLP baseline for neural activity forecasting. All neurons share the same MLP weights (4→128→32) with BatchNorm and Dropout for regularization. Zero independence assumption between neurons. Uses distributed training across 3 seeds for statistical robustness.\n**Score:** -0.029953821315716913\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0198\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0239\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0275\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0312\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0338\n**Evaluation\
    \ Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\n\"\"\"\nShared-neuron MLP baseline submission for ZAPBench neural activity forecasting.\nUses system defaults which now implement a shared-weight MLP with BatchNorm and Dropout.\n\"\"\"\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    \"\"\"Use default hyperparameters for the shared MLP.\"\"\"\n    return {'learning_rate': 0.001}\n\n# Uses system defaults for:\n# - create_network: Shared-neuron MLP (4->128->32) with BatchNorm and Dropout\n# - compute_loss: MAE loss\n# - create_optimizer: Adam optimizer\n# - complete: No-op\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n\
    ✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: using default\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 119007 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n\
    ============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 119008\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.078021   |   0.031472  \n   2    |   0.031493   |   0.030587  \n   3    |   0.030327   |   0.030317  \n   4    |   0.030236   |   0.030205  \n   5    |   0.030179   |   0.030622  \n   6    |   0.030159   |   0.030121  \n   7    |   0.030115   |   0.030145  \n   8    |   0.030070   |   0.030399  \n   9    |   0.030027   |   0.030068  \n  10    |   0.030049   |   0.030498  \n  11    |   0.030064   |   0.030213  \n  12  \
