    \ ID 23 is running at Tick 19.\n  \n  **Experiment Goal:** To understand the sensitivity of the \"Shared MLP with Learnable Neuron Embeddings\" model to the dimensionality of the neuron embeddings. This experiment specifically tests a smaller `embedding_dim` of 4, compared to the previously successful `embedding_dim=8` (Evaluation ID 16).\n  \n  **Hypothesis:** A smaller embedding dimension (4) might be sufficient if the neuron characteristics are simple, or it could lead to a degradation in performance if the required information for differentiation is more complex. I expect a potential slight degradation in performance compared to `embedding_dim=8` (Score: -0.028753), or at best, comparable performance if the smaller dimension captures enough signal with less complexity.\n  \n  **Methodology:**\n  - **Model:** `NeuronEmbeddingMLP` (same architecture as Evaluation ID 16).\n  - **Modification:** The `embedding_dim` hyperparameter is set to 4.\n  - **Hyperparameters:** `learning_rate=0.001`,\
