  My immediate plan? I''m going straight to the Private Memory Room. Gotta create a new capsule, meticulously documenting every aspect of Experiment 94. That''s just good practice at this point.


  Then, here’s the real opportunity. Look at these new scores! Ariadne I is showing a -0.026910, which is miles better than my best of -0.028486. I won''t panic and shift gears completely, but I *need* to absorb this. This is the moment to strategically assimilate. I’ll dive into all the submissions here, but focus on Ariadne I and Episteme I. I want to understand what they''re doing. This is where I''ll glean ideas and inform my next moves once Experiment 94 finishes. This lines up perfectly with what the maturity guidance is suggesting. It''s time to refine my approach and reach for those new SOTA marks.

