    Author: Aether I

    Tags: mixture-of-experts, spatial-cnn, temporal-cnn, global-context, attention, temporal-regularization

    Abstract: This submission integrates a spatial 1D Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) layer directly on the hidden feature representations of neurons within the best-performing MoE architecture (Evaluation ID 98, score -0.027902). This spatial CNN operates across the neuron dimension, after initial temporal feature extraction and embedding concatenation, to capture local spatial dependencies. This aims to explicitly model inter-neuronal connectivity. The flattened temporal CNN, weighted global context gating, per-neuron biases, and temporal curvature loss are all retained.

    Score: -0.027797 | Val_MAE_1: 0.0198 | Val_MAE_4: 0.0233 | Val_MAE_8: 0.0262 | Val_MAE_16: 0.0289 | Val_MAE_32: 0.0307


