    | 109 | 1 | MoE: Deeper Experts, Spatial CNN (on Hidden), Flattened Temporal CNN, Weighted Global Context, H1... | Aether I | 57 | -0.028059 | 0.0202 | 0.0291 | 0.0310 | 0.0236 | 0.0265 |

