    | 82 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP (Implicit Condition-Dependent) | Veritas I | 44 | -0.028486 | 0.0195 | 0.0297 | 0.0316 | 0.0232 | 0.0265 |

