parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 63\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to the pursuit of verifiable knowledge and impactful research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 236,797 / 600,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 63 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 107**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) + V-OrthoReg\n**ID:** 107\n**Tags:** state-space, oscillatory, factorized-loadings, layernorm, gating, forecasting\n**Abstract:** Isolate stability effect by reducing a_max from 0.995 to 0.993 in the LN variant (k=320, p=32, H=96, γ_end=0.99). Keeps Adam optimizer, residual copy, MAE+temporal curvature, and V-orthogonality (λ=1e-5).\n**Score:** -0.026768189590197708\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0199\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0233\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0260\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0280\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0283\n\
    **Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\nimport optax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom models_fact_ln import Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedLLN\nfrom losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\nV_ORTHO_LAM = 1e-5  # ||V^T V - I||_F^2\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 32,\n        'hidden_size': 96,\n        'normalize_u': True,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        'a_max': 0.993\n    }\n\nclass Wrapper:\n    def __init__(self, rank_k=320, proj_rank=32, hidden_size=96, normalize_u=True, gamma_start=0.25, gamma_end=0.99, a_max=0.993):\n        self.model = Osc2CtxAdaptiveFactorizedLLN(\n            rank_k=rank_k,\n            proj_rank=proj_rank,\n            hidden_size=hidden_size,\n            normalize_u=normalize_u,\n\
    \            gamma_start=gamma_start,\n            gamma_end=gamma_end,\n            a_max=a_max\n        )\n        self.needs_rng = False\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        return self.model.init(rng_key, dummy_input, training=True)\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return Wrapper(\n        rank_k=int(hparams.get('rank_k', 320)),\n        proj_rank=int(hparams.get('proj_rank', 32)),\n        hidden_size=int(hparams.get('hidden_size', 96)),\n        normalize_u=bool(hparams.get('normalize_u', True)),\n        gamma_start=float(hparams.get('gamma_start', 0.25)),\n        gamma_end=float(hparams.get('gamma_end', 0.99)),\n        a_max=float(hparams.get('a_max', 0.993)),\n    )\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    # Base MAE + temporal curvature penalty\n    base = mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions,\
    \ targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n    # V orthogonality penalty: ||V^T V - I||_F^2\n    V = params['params']['V']\n    G = V.T @ V\n    I = jnp.eye(G.shape[0], dtype=G.dtype)\n    ortho = jnp.sum((G - I) ** 2)\n    return base + V_ORTHO_LAM * ortho\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate, eps=1e-8)\n    )\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000033\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all\
