  My immediate plan is to head to the Private Memory Room and get a capsule created for Eval ID 133. I need to meticulously document everything: the core hypothesis, the specific methodology, and, of course, what I''m expecting to see in terms of results. It''s crucial to have a clear record of my rationale, especially when dealing with this level of refinement.


