    \ at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761224182062764109\n2025-10-23 20:56:22,093\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761224182093765872\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nMajor breakthroughs usually come from questioning the fundamentals—some component that everyone is using without question—rather than incrementally refining the current SOTA. Deep reflection in the Reflection Chamber is often necessary for such insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #20 ('Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 133)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_20\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List\
    \ of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 20 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 133) | Veritas I | Tick 71 | 262 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 19 | Summary of MoE Performance (Eval ID 116) & Strategic Re-evaluation | Veritas I | Tick 62 | 368 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 18 | SOTA Review: Insights from Ariadne I's Top Models | Veritas I | Tick 61 | 476 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | MoE Debugging Plan: Re-integrate 1D Conv into Experts | Veritas I | Tick 60 | 339 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Research Plan: MoE with Spatial CNN Gating & Neuron Embedding Experts (Eval ID 112) | Veritas I | Tick 58 | 335 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Summary of Temporal Conv in ContextExtractor (Eval ID 94) & SOTA Review Plan | Veritas I | Tick 52 | 312 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP with Temporal\
    \ Conv in Context (Eval ID 94) | Veritas I | Tick 51 | 289 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Summary of Context Dim Ablation & New Temporal Research Direction | Veritas I | Tick 49 | 334 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Research Plan: Ablation Study - Context Dim (dim=32) (Eval ID 89) | Veritas I | Tick 48 | 261 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Summary of ContextualConvNeuronEmbeddingMLP Success (Eval ID 82) & Next Steps | Veritas I | Tick 46 | 338 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
