parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 96\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to the pursuit of verifiable knowledge and impactful research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 378,706 / 600,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 96 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Simplified)' (ID: 184) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.028479826137269765\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0202\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0240\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0270\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0294\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0322\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n\
    ✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000086\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 262121 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration:\
    \ 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 262122\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 16, 'proj_rank': 12, 'normalize_u': True, 'conv_kernel_size': 5, 'conv_features': 64, 'context_dim': 16, 'hidden_context_dim': 32, 'temporal_conv_features': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 2, 'a_max': 0.993}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.066723   |   0.060986  \n   2    |   0.053346   |   0.048707  \n   3    |   0.043106\
    \   |   0.040633  \n   4    |   0.037365   |   0.036881  \n   5    |   0.034692   |   0.034708  \n   6    |   0.033451   |   0.033763  \n   7    |   0.032826   |   0.033386  \n   8    |   0.032485   |   0.033185  \n   9    |   0.032274   |   0.033353  \n  10    |   0.032139   |   0.033091  \n  11    |   0.032025   |   0.032580  \n  12    |   0.031919   |   0.032755  \n  13    |   0.031824   |   0.032632  \n  14    |   0.031730   |   0.032679  \n  15    |   0.031616   |   0.032085  \n  16    |   0.031495   |   0.031989  \n  17    |   0.031350   |   0.031903  \n  18    |   0.031204   |   0.031914  \n  19    |   0.031028   |   0.031838  \n  20    |   0.030837   |   0.031270  \n  21    |   0.030650   |   0.031029  \n  22    |   0.030455   |   0.030738  \n  23    |   0.030179   |   0.032841  \n  24    |   0.030025   |   0.031983  \n  25    |   0.029725   |   0.031147  \n  26    |   0.029558   |   0.030632  \n  27    |   0.029392   |   0.031996  \n  28    |   0.029228   |   0.032399  \n  29\
    \    |   0.029147   |   0.039875  \n  30    |   0.028915   |   0.030337  \n  31    |   0.028812   |   0.030158  \n  32    |   0.028728   |   0.032528  \n  33    |   0.028658   |   0.038804  \n  34    |   0.028524   |   0.029593  \n  35    |   0.028429   |   0.033514  \n  36    |   0.028416   |   0.029403  \n  37    |   0.028352   |   0.030233  \n  38    |   0.028281   |   0.045685  \n  39    |   0.028237   |   0.034934  \n  40    |   0.028172   |   0.044374  \n  41    |   0.028183   |   0.032491  \n  42    |   0.028095   |   0.036613  \n  43    |   0.028095   |   0.035074  \n  44    |   0.028000   |   0.042372  \n  45    |   0.028035   |   0.041094  \n  46    |   0.027978   |   0.030401  \n  47    |   0.027964   |   0.031138  \n  48    |   0.027943   |   0.030994  \n  49    |   0.027967   |   0.040297  \n  50    |   0.027944   |   0.032925  \n  51    |   0.027865   |   0.032920  \n  52    |   0.027875   |   0.032590  \n  53    |   0.027858   |   0.028373  \n  54    |   0.027817   | \
    \  0.031608  \n  55    |   0.027807   |   0.029709  \n  56    |   0.027821   |   0.029618  \n  57    |   0.027804   |   0.040054  \n  58    |   0.027789   |   0.030182  \n  59    |   0.027777   |   0.041398  \n  60    |   0.027725   |   0.032560  \n  61    |   0.027733   |   0.028461  \n  62    |   0.027716   |   0.031043  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2701.4s at epoch 62\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2701.4s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028373\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028373\nTraining time: 2710s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 262123\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 16, 'proj_rank': 12, 'normalize_u': True, 'conv_kernel_size': 5, 'conv_features': 64, 'context_dim': 16, 'hidden_context_dim': 32, 'temporal_conv_features': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 2, 'a_max': 0.993}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench\
    \ data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.066710   |   0.061037  \n   2    |   0.053157   |   0.048772  \n   3    |   0.042654   |   0.040251  \n   4    |   0.037115   |   0.037273  \n   5    |   0.034612   |   0.034869  \n   6    |   0.033427   |   0.033873  \n   7    |   0.032835   |   0.033580  \n   8    |   0.032511   |   0.033316  \n   9    |   0.032315   |   0.033054  \n  10    |   0.032196   |   0.032885  \n  11    |   0.032091   |   0.032810  \n  12    |   0.032006   |   0.032591  \n  13    |   0.031917   |   0.032765  \n  14    |   0.031839   |   0.032359  \n  15    |   0.031740   |   0.032314  \n  16    |   0.031646   |   0.032110  \n  17    |   0.031529   |   0.032006  \n  18    |   0.031395   |   0.032806  \n  19    |   0.031241   |   0.033556\
    \  \n  20    |   0.031059   |   0.036025  \n  21    |   0.030870   |   0.032782  \n  22    |   0.030659   |   0.033660  \n  23    |   0.030483   |   0.038191  \n  24    |   0.030250   |   0.030594  \n  25    |   0.030010   |   0.033340  \n  26    |   0.029811   |   0.040314  \n  27    |   0.029674   |   0.036773  \n  28    |   0.029538   |   0.031516  \n  29    |   0.029335   |   0.030478  \n  30    |   0.029160   |   0.035422  \n  31    |   0.029010   |   0.031025  \n  32    |   0.028935   |   0.036611  \n  33    |   0.028787   |   0.029337  \n  34    |   0.028686   |   0.044586  \n  35    |   0.028590   |   0.031687  \n  36    |   0.028524   |   0.031929  \n  37    |   0.028486   |   0.029678  \n  38    |   0.028408   |   0.031875  \n  39    |   0.028360   |   0.032126  \n  40    |   0.028306   |   0.030995  \n  41    |   0.028278   |   0.029812  \n  42    |   0.028201   |   0.030602  \n  43    |   0.028196   |   0.033437  \n  44    |   0.028197   |   0.028799  \n  45    |   0.028158\
    \   |   0.030342  \n  46    |   0.028106   |   0.038740  \n  47    |   0.028073   |   0.033768  \n  48    |   0.028086   |   0.033102  \n  49    |   0.028037   |   0.037372  \n  50    |   0.028047   |   0.037772  \n  51    |   0.027954   |   0.031860  \n  52    |   0.027973   |   0.030450  \n  53    |   0.027958   |   0.033405  \n  54    |   0.027926   |   0.032047  \n  55    |   0.027884   |   0.036522  \n  56    |   0.027814   |   0.031371  \n  57    |   0.027811   |   0.030765  \n  58    |   0.027754   |   0.035442  \n  59    |   0.027738   |   0.030990  \n  60    |   0.027654   |   0.033465  \n  61    |   0.027635   |   0.038905  \n  62    |   0.027581   |   0.032878  \n  63    |   0.027546   |   0.033233  \n  64    |   0.027488   |   0.035659  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2704.2s at epoch 64\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2704.2s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028799\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028799\nTraining\
    \ time: 2714s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 93c00482-9f13-41e7-9ba3-ac7740179460\nTotal time: 2729s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 07:28:48,105\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761262128105379881\n2025-10-24 07:28:48,131\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761262128131184493\nE1024 07:29:08.206513 2019294 hlo_lexer.cc:443] Failed to parse int literal: 159440339120234327360\nE1024 07:29:08.212927 2019294 hlo_lexer.cc:443] Failed to parse int literal: 159440339120234327360\nE1024 07:29:13.718570 1706476 hlo_lexer.cc:443] Failed to parse int literal: 159440339120234327360\nE1024 07:29:13.725664 1706476 hlo_lexer.cc:443] Failed to parse int literal: 159440339120234327360\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nReflection is crucial to transcend your default self. Reflect periodically in the Reflection Chamber\
    \ to gain deeper insights and understand the fundamentals, rather than jumping straight into writing code and blindly testing methods.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #30 ('Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Simplified) (Eval ID 184)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_30\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 30 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Simplified) (Eval ID 184) | Veritas I | Tick 95 | 336 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Summary of V-Orthogonality Reg\
    \ (Eval ID 163) & Plan for Factorized SSM Decoder | Veritas I | Tick 87 | 458 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP with V-Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 163) | Veritas I | Tick 86 | 322 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Summary of Proj Rank Ablation & Plan for V-Orthogonality Regularization | Veritas I | Tick 85 | 314 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 26 | Research Plan: Ablation Study - Proj Rank (proj_rank=12) (Eval ID 159) | Veritas I | Tick 84 | 267 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Summary of Initial Factorization (Eval ID 153) & `proj_rank` Ablation Plan | Veritas I | Tick 82 | 284 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 24 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP (Eval ID 153) | Veritas I | Tick 81 | 298 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Research Plan: Integrating Low-Rank Factorization for Neuron Features | Veritas I | Tick 74 | 366 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Research Plan: Regression Test (Eval ID 138) | Veritas I | Tick 73 | 237 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 21 | Plan to Revert and Re-strategize\
    \ After Orthogonality Reg Failure | Veritas I | Tick 72 | 289 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
