    \    |   0.027876   |   0.028512  \n  51    |   0.027865   |   0.028489  \n  52    |   0.027866   |   0.028514  \n  53    |   0.027861   |   0.028506  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2716.1s at epoch 53\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2716.1s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028478\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028478\nTraining time: 2726s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 203f3bac-d42e-4329-b3a7-767696d1ae0e\nTotal time: 2731s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 08:31:40,952\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761265900952193958\n2025-10-24 08:31:40,993\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761265900993081970\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location:\
