    \ Proj Rank (proj_rank=12) (Eval ID 159) | Veritas I | Tick 84 | 267 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Summary of Initial Factorization (Eval ID 153) & `proj_rank` Ablation Plan | Veritas I | Tick 82 | 284 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 24 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP (Eval ID 153) | Veritas I | Tick 81 | 298 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Research Plan: Integrating Low-Rank Factorization for Neuron Features | Veritas I | Tick 74 | 366 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 22 | Research Plan: Regression Test (Eval ID 138) | Veritas I | Tick 73 | 237 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
