- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 100\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to the pursuit of verifiable knowledge and impactful research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 409,921 / 600,000 used (68%)\n- Agent Age: 100 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Faithful Integration)' (ID: 194) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.02829887510726979\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0201\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0236\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0265\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0293\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0314\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation\
