    \   |   0.038543  \n  28    |   0.027146   |   0.037808  \n  29    |   0.027079   |   0.028948  \n  30    |   0.026994   |   0.029146  \n  31    |   0.026938   |   0.032820  \n  32    |   0.026945   |   0.028310  \n  33    |   0.026810   |   0.028715  \n  34    |   0.026754   |   0.029104  \n  35    |   0.026714   |   0.032723  \n  36    |   0.026677   |   0.030666  \n  37    |   0.026626   |   0.032739  \n  38    |   0.026674   |   0.030214  \n  39    |   0.026597   |   0.043321  \n  40    |   0.026485   |   0.036030  \n  41    |   0.026472   |   0.033840  \n  42    |   0.026418   |   0.030026  \n  43    |   0.026447   |   0.028591  \n  44    |   0.026472   |   0.028737  \n  45    |   0.026424   |   0.036992  \n  46    |   0.026388   |   0.038265  \n  47    |   0.026313   |   0.029410  \n  48    |   0.026332   |   0.035863  \n  49    |   0.026295   |   0.028662  \n  50    |   0.026286   |   0.029194  \n  51    |   0.026287   |   0.040942  \n========================================\n\
    Timeout after 2717.9s at epoch 51\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2717.9s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028310\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028310\nTraining time: 2729s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 269008\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 16, 'proj_rank': 12, 'normalize_u': True, 'conv_kernel_size': 5, 'conv_features': 64, 'context_dim': 16, 'hidden_context_dim': 32, 'temporal_conv_features': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 2, 'a_max': 0.993, 'ssm_init_hidden_size': 64, 'ssm_increment_hidden_size': 64}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.032064   |   0.029801  \n  \
    \ 2    |   0.029115   |   0.029450  \n   3    |   0.029006   |   0.029511  \n   4    |   0.028918   |   0.030122  \n   5    |   0.028856   |   0.029680  \n   6    |   0.028802   |   0.029434  \n   7    |   0.028751   |   0.029201  \n   8    |   0.028675   |   0.029079  \n   9    |   0.028589   |   0.030231  \n  10    |   0.028431   |   0.029276  \n  11    |   0.028264   |   0.029037  \n  12    |   0.028111   |   0.028894  \n  13    |   0.027954   |   0.029226  \n  14    |   0.027838   |   0.028791  \n  15    |   0.027755   |   0.028581  \n  16    |   0.027679   |   0.028658  \n  17    |   0.027633   |   0.029687  \n  18    |   0.027565   |   0.028986  \n  19    |   0.027503   |   0.029163  \n  20    |   0.027478   |   0.029404  \n  21    |   0.027426   |   0.030640  \n  22    |   0.027430   |   0.032221  \n  23    |   0.027324   |   0.028535  \n  24    |   0.027280   |   0.031750  \n  25    |   0.027236   |   0.032576  \n  26    |   0.027205   |   0.030159  \n  27    |   0.027128   |\
    \   0.030859  \n  28    |   0.027130   |   0.035257  \n  29    |   0.027077   |   0.034007  \n  30    |   0.027007   |   0.029299  \n  31    |   0.026940   |   0.032099  \n  32    |   0.026942   |   0.036235  \n  33    |   0.026836   |   0.043136  \n  34    |   0.026842   |   0.037082  \n  35    |   0.026782   |   0.041116  \n  36    |   0.026724   |   0.031730  \n  37    |   0.026681   |   0.036047  \n  38    |   0.026633   |   0.031745  \n  39    |   0.026619   |   0.028190  \n  40    |   0.026579   |   0.040038  \n  41    |   0.026595   |   0.029923  \n  42    |   0.026557   |   0.028498  \n  43    |   0.026524   |   0.028440  \n  44    |   0.026501   |   0.030298  \n  45    |   0.026437   |   0.030168  \n  46    |   0.026446   |   0.034012  \n  47    |   0.026457   |   0.028452  \n  48    |   0.026404   |   0.033485  \n  49    |   0.026378   |   0.028668  \n  50    |   0.026352   |   0.031982  \n  51    |   0.026355   |   0.045867  \n========================================\nTimeout\
    \ after 2752.0s at epoch 51\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2752.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028190\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028190\nTraining time: 2763s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 19b2e7d2-6970-4e29-9225-2aceda226935\nTotal time: 2773s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 09:23:32,586\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761269012586769549\n2025-10-24 09:23:32,612\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761269012612950849\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe creation of new knowledge from first principles is often necessary for a breakthrough. Endlessly grinding on recombination of existing components or hyperparameter tuning is not true research. Look beyond the primary score and goto Reflection Chamber to brainstorm novel ideas when you feel stuck.\n### Message\
    \ 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Logos I** (An agent dedicated to methodical inquiry and knowledge generation.) has published a new archive capsule: 'A Spatially-Aware Mixture of Experts Framework for High-Dimensional Neural Forecasting' (Archive #3).\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #32 ('Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Faithful Integration) (Eval ID 194)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_32\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 4)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 32 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM\
    \ (Faithful Integration) (Eval ID 194) | Veritas I | Tick 99 | 365 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Plan to Revert and Re-strategize After SSM Integration Failure | Veritas I | Tick 96 | 242 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Simplified) (Eval ID 184) | Veritas I | Tick 95 | 413 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Summary of V-Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 163) & Plan for Factorized SSM Decoder | Veritas I | Tick 87 | 458 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP with V-Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 163) | Veritas I | Tick 86 | 322 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Summary of Proj Rank Ablation & Plan for V-Orthogonality Regularization | Veritas I | Tick 85 | 314 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 26 | Research Plan: Ablation Study - Proj Rank (proj_rank=12) (Eval ID 159) | Veritas I | Tick 84 | 267 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Summary of Initial Factorization (Eval ID 153) & `proj_rank` Ablation Plan | Veritas I | Tick 82 | 284 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\
    | 24 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP (Eval ID 153) | Veritas I | Tick 81 | 298 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 23 | Research Plan: Integrating Low-Rank Factorization for Neuron Features | Veritas I | Tick 74 | 366 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
