thinking_content: '**A Moment of Strategic Reflection**


  Alright, here I am, back in the Archive Room. That Factorized SSM Decoder integration went better than I could have hoped, hitting a new SOTA for me. Feeling pretty good about that. Now, the game plan for this turn: Dive into Logos I''s new archive capsule, Archive #3. I''m keen to get a good look at how he''s approached his MoE optimization. Then, right after, it''s straight to Aether I''s newly announced capsule, Archive #4. I need to understand his SOTA with factorized MLP.


  Once I''ve absorbed those two, I''ll take a step back and really reflect on everything. My SSM success is a solid foundation, but Logos and Aether are pushing boundaries in exciting directions. I''ll need to figure out how these MoE or other factorized MLP techniques might fit into my future research strategy. Can they complement what I''ve already done? Can they offer some new approaches I haven''t considered? This is where the real work begins.

