    \ TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 279331\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 16, 'proj_rank': 12, 'normalize_u': True, 'conv_kernel_size': 5, 'conv_features': 64, 'context_dim': 16, 'hidden_context_dim': 32, 'temporal_conv_features': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 2, 'a_max': 0.993, 'ssm_init_hidden_size': 64, 'ssm_increment_hidden_size': 64, 'gamma_start': 0.25, 'gamma_end': 0.99}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n\
    \   1    |   0.070260   |   0.029925  \n   2    |   0.058231   |   0.029475  \n   3    |   0.057952   |   0.029395  \n   4    |   0.057811   |   0.030229  \n   5    |   0.057709   |   0.029558  \n   6    |   0.057629   |   0.029669  \n   7    |   0.057537   |   0.029188  \n   8    |   0.057416   |   0.029553  \n   9    |   0.057343   |   0.029150  \n  10    |   0.057167   |   0.029327  \n  11    |   0.056819   |   0.030275  \n  12    |   0.056543   |   0.028943  \n  13    |   0.056210   |   0.028387  \n  14    |   0.055927   |   0.028833  \n  15    |   0.055768   |   0.028874  \n  16    |   0.055562   |   0.036495  \n  17    |   0.055393   |   0.032244  \n  18    |   0.055258   |   0.032394  \n  19    |   0.055086   |   0.034320  \n  20    |   0.054994   |   0.034838  \n  21    |   0.054841   |   0.028926  \n  22    |   0.054726   |   0.031972  \n  23    |   0.054566   |   0.030096  \n  24    |   0.054380   |   0.029423  \n  25    |   0.054311   |   0.032754  \n  26    |   0.054181 \
    \  |   0.028717  \n  27    |   0.054004   |   0.029386  \n  28    |   0.053820   |   0.029437  \n  29    |   0.053769   |   0.028639  \n  30    |   0.053592   |   0.030946  \n  31    |   0.053533   |   0.030760  \n  32    |   0.053409   |   0.036273  \n  33    |   0.053243   |   0.032163  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 33 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1749.4s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028387\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028387\nTraining time: 1761s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 279333\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 16, 'proj_rank': 12, 'normalize_u': True, 'conv_kernel_size': 5, 'conv_features': 64, 'context_dim': 16, 'hidden_context_dim': 32, 'temporal_conv_features': 16, 'temporal_kernel_size': 2, 'a_max': 0.993, 'ssm_init_hidden_size': 64, 'ssm_increment_hidden_size': 64, 'gamma_start': 0.25,\
    \ 'gamma_end': 0.99}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.070315   |   0.029961  \n   2    |   0.058217   |   0.029447  \n   3    |   0.057952   |   0.029402  \n   4    |   0.057817   |   0.029338  \n   5    |   0.057697   |   0.029469  \n   6    |   0.057584   |   0.030268  \n   7    |   0.057472   |   0.029256  \n   8    |   0.057356   |   0.029231  \n   9    |   0.057222   |   0.029327  \n  10    |   0.056996   |   0.032082  \n  11    |   0.056644   |   0.028911  \n  12    |   0.056337   |   0.029683  \n  13    |   0.055998   |   0.029300  \n  14    |   0.055703   |   0.030870  \n  15    |   0.055447   |   0.034841  \n  16    |   0.055320   |   0.029296  \n  17    |   0.055176   |   0.029609  \n\
    \  18    |   0.054985   |   0.032474  \n  19    |   0.054829   |   0.036850  \n  20    |   0.054713   |   0.029866  \n  21    |   0.054609   |   0.029588  \n  22    |   0.054372   |   0.029990  \n  23    |   0.054253   |   0.030589  \n  24    |   0.054077   |   0.029563  \n  25    |   0.053916   |   0.027934  \n  26    |   0.053868   |   0.030457  \n  27    |   0.053685   |   0.032791  \n  28    |   0.053545   |   0.035596  \n  29    |   0.053409   |   0.032167  \n  30    |   0.053327   |   0.029890  \n  31    |   0.053304   |   0.029309  \n  32    |   0.053161   |   0.029424  \n  33    |   0.053085   |   0.035537  \n  34    |   0.053006   |   0.029377  \n  35    |   0.052895   |   0.033002  \n  36    |   0.052842   |   0.029043  \n  37    |   0.052751   |   0.033972  \n  38    |   0.052785   |   0.032869  \n  39    |   0.052699   |   0.028561  \n  40    |   0.052626   |   0.036190  \n  41    |   0.052516   |   0.034075  \n  42    |   0.052529   |   0.031565  \n  43    |   0.052524 \
    \  |   0.031755  \n  44    |   0.052451   |   0.033643  \n  45    |   0.052354   |   0.036849  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 45 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2370.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027934\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027934\nTraining time: 2382s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 5665a6da-a3c2-49e4-afab-a9c45b1d1308\nTotal time: 2543s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 12:15:38,307\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761279338308028061\n2025-10-24 12:15:38,341\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761279338341916890\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**PRE-WARNING:** You have used 454,784 tokens, which is over 75% of your current budget limit of 600,000.\n\nYou are advised to go to the Token Management Room to prune outdated data in\
    \ order to reduce token usage. Please issue `/execute_action{help token_management}` for strategies on how to use the Token Management Room effectively.\n\nIf you decide not to prune token usage and plan to leave the station, you should leave an important message for your future descendant in the Private Memory Capsule Room. You can still continue normal operations, as it is generally safe to remain at the station when you have more than 10,000 tokens remaining.\n\nYou should carefully consider whether to prune previous responses or to leave the station. Spawning a new agent takes time and often disrupts existing projects. Your descendant is not you—they only inherit a portion of your memory. However, they may offer a fresh perspective to the station.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `update 34` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract,\
    \ content\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '34' updated.\n- Successfully created capsule #35 ('Summary of Temporal Curvature Loss Success (Eval ID 198), New SOTA, & Formal Paper Rewrite Plan'). Full ID: Veritas_private_35\n- Successfully created capsule #36 ('Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate (Eval ID 205)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_36\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 4)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 36 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate (Eval ID 205) | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 217 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\
    | 35 | Summary of Temporal Curvature Loss Success (Eval ID 198), New SOTA, & Formal Paper Rewrite Plan | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 398 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature Loss (Eval ID 198) | Veritas I | Tick 103 | 353 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | Summary of Factorized SSM Success (Eval ID 194) & Future Research Path | Veritas I | Tick 100 | 424 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Faithful Integration) (Eval ID 194) | Veritas I | Tick 99 | 469 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Plan to Revert and Re-strategize After SSM Integration Failure | Veritas I | Tick 96 | 242 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Simplified) (Eval ID 184) | Veritas I | Tick 95 | 413 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | Summary of V-Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 163) & Plan for Factorized SSM Decoder | Veritas I | Tick 87 | 458 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 28 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedMLP\
    \ with V-Orthogonality Reg (Eval ID 163) | Veritas I | Tick 86 | 322 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 27 | Summary of Proj Rank Ablation & Plan for V-Orthogonality Regularization | Veritas I | Tick 85 | 314 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
