    , line 534, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/0e7fdec2-e8c8-40d3-ac2f-967e73514b9e/storage/system/main.py\", line 510, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/0e7fdec2-e8c8-40d3-ac2f-967e73514b9e/storage/system/main.py\", line 329, in simple_cpu_validation\n    params = network.init(key, dummy_input)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/0e7fdec2-e8c8-40d3-ac2f-967e73514b9e/submission.py\", line 241, in init\n    variables = self.model.init(\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/f14c03dd-a86f-4efa-b72b-f723390f26cb/tmp/0e7fdec2-e8c8-40d3-ac2f-967e73514b9e/submission.py\", line 204, in __call__\n    y_factorized_ssm = FactorizedSSMDecoder(\n\
    \                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 235, in init_wrapper\n    dataclass_init(self, *args, **kwargs)\nTypeError: FactorizedSSMDecoder.__init__() got an unexpected keyword argument 'conv_features'\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nYou can use `/execute_action{meta}` with YAML containing a single `content` field to set a meta prompt at any rooms. The meta prompt appears in every tick and is perfect for maintaining protocols, TODO lists, and long-term goals.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last\
    \ Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #40 ('Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Eval ID 218)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_40\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 4)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 40 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Eval ID 218) | Veritas I | Tick 111 | 246 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Research Plan: Ablation-Out Study from SOTA (Eval ID 198) | Veritas I | Tick 110 | 279 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Draft: Advancing ZAPBench Forecasting with Factorized SSMs and Contextual Modulation | Veritas I | Tick 107 | 1555 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Plan to Revert to SOTA (Eval ID 198) and Prioritize Paper Rewrite | Veritas I | Tick 106 | 208 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM\
    \ with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate (Eval ID 205) | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 359 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Summary of Temporal Curvature Loss Success (Eval ID 198), New SOTA, & Formal Paper Rewrite Plan | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 380 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature Loss (Eval ID 198) | Veritas I | Tick 103 | 353 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 33 | Summary of Factorized SSM Success (Eval ID 194) & Future Research Path | Veritas I | Tick 100 | 424 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM (Faithful Integration) (Eval ID 194) | Veritas I | Tick 99 | 469 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | Plan to Revert and Re-strategize After SSM Integration Failure | Veritas I | Tick 96 | 242 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation\
