    \ 0.058014   |   0.029343  \n   4    |   0.057824   |   0.029391  \n   5    |   0.057681   |   0.030292  \n   6    |   0.057576   |   0.029414  \n   7    |   0.057462   |   0.030131  \n   8    |   0.057346   |   0.029178  \n   9    |   0.057067   |   0.028923  \n  10    |   0.056785   |   0.029824  \n  11    |   0.056571   |   0.028588  \n  12    |   0.056276   |   0.031568  \n  13    |   0.056159   |   0.028634  \n  14    |   0.055979   |   0.028966  \n  15    |   0.055840   |   0.031258  \n  16    |   0.055701   |   0.031676  \n  17    |   0.055505   |   0.031052  \n  18    |   0.055397   |   0.037344  \n  19    |   0.055345   |   0.029463  \n  20    |   0.055163   |   0.029492  \n  21    |   0.055131   |   0.029630  \n  22    |   0.054961   |   0.033108  \n  23    |   0.054899   |   0.030759  \n  24    |   0.054812   |   0.032502  \n  25    |   0.054705   |   0.032492  \n  26    |   0.054637   |   0.029698  \n  27    |   0.054527   |   0.036662  \n  28    |   0.054466   |   0.033830\
    \  \n  29    |   0.054357   |   0.029062  \n  30    |   0.054216   |   0.029960  \n  31    |   0.054097   |   0.029259  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 31 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1625.1s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028588\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028588\nTraining time: 1636s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 303542\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'embedding_dim': 16, 'proj_rank': 12, 'normalize_u': True, 'conv_kernel_size': 5, 'conv_features': 64, 'context_dim': 16, 'hidden_context_dim': 32, 'a_max': 0.993, 'ssm_init_hidden_size': 64, 'ssm_increment_hidden_size': 64}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |\
    \  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.063677   |   0.029643  \n   2    |   0.058243   |   0.029438  \n   3    |   0.057998   |   0.029746  \n   4    |   0.057808   |   0.029389  \n   5    |   0.057702   |   0.029490  \n   6    |   0.057622   |   0.029742  \n   7    |   0.057537   |   0.029165  \n   8    |   0.057457   |   0.029493  \n   9    |   0.057332   |   0.030049  \n  10    |   0.057158   |   0.029825  \n  11    |   0.056891   |   0.037590  \n  12    |   0.056582   |   0.030275  \n  13    |   0.056395   |   0.030096  \n  14    |   0.056135   |   0.028576  \n  15    |   0.055997   |   0.031196  \n  16    |   0.055845   |   0.029419  \n  17    |   0.055652   |   0.029113  \n  18    |   0.055500   |   0.031475  \n  19    |   0.055455   |   0.031114  \n  20    |   0.055274   |   0.033075  \n  21    |   0.055113   |   0.028754  \n  22    |   0.055085   |   0.028626  \n  23    |   0.054998   |   0.029380  \n  24    |   0.054844   |   0.032144\
    \  \n  25    |   0.054744   |   0.028742  \n  26    |   0.054690   |   0.029652  \n  27    |   0.054469   |   0.034974  \n  28    |   0.054427   |   0.029758  \n  29    |   0.054255   |   0.029014  \n  30    |   0.054129   |   0.029315  \n  31    |   0.054021   |   0.029545  \n  32    |   0.053956   |   0.033822  \n  33    |   0.053812   |   0.029595  \n  34    |   0.053762   |   0.029816  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 34 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1915.2s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028576\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028576\nTraining time: 1926s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 70174ec8-aaca-4310-999a-461de5a5e882\nTotal time: 2079s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 18:59:07,580\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761303547580390166\n2025-10-24 18:59:07,616\t\
    INFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761303547616513970\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #44 ('Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Temporal Conv in ContextExtractor (Eval ID 239)'). Full ID: Veritas_private_44\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 5)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 44 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Temporal Conv in ContextExtractor (Eval ID 239) | Veritas I | Tick 117 | 203 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 43 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No FiLM Modulation (Eval ID 233) | Veritas\
    \ I | Tick 115 | 254 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 42 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Corrected) (Eval ID 227) | Veritas I | Tick 113 | 231 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 41 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Eval ID 218 Corrected) | Veritas I | Tick 112 | 223 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Eval ID 218) | Veritas I | Tick 111 | 275 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Research Plan: Ablation-Out Study from SOTA (Eval ID 198) | Veritas I | Tick 110 | 310 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 38 | Draft: Advancing ZAPBench Forecasting with Factorized SSMs and Contextual Modulation | Veritas I | Tick 107 | 1555 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 37 | Plan to Revert to SOTA (Eval ID 198) and Prioritize Paper Rewrite | Veritas I | Tick 106 | 208 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate (Eval ID 205) | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 359 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Summary of Temporal Curvature Loss\
    \ Success (Eval ID 198), New SOTA, & Formal Paper Rewrite Plan | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 380 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-5.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
