    \  \n  22    |   0.054585   |   0.028560  \n  23    |   0.054441   |   0.028453  \n  24    |   0.054353   |   0.028965  \n  25    |   0.054243   |   0.042313  \n  26    |   0.054177   |   0.029985  \n  27    |   0.054050   |   0.028458  \n  28    |   0.053853   |   0.030071  \n  29    |   0.053950   |   0.029914  \n  30    |   0.053737   |   0.031495  \n  31    |   0.053657   |   0.031926  \n  32    |   0.053478   |   0.029312  \n  33    |   0.053446   |   0.030363  \n  34    |   0.053349   |   0.029528  \n  35    |   0.053285   |   0.036189  \n  36    |   0.053236   |   0.029159  \n  37    |   0.053145   |   0.028537  \n  38    |   0.053119   |   0.029337  \n  39    |   0.052986   |   0.029374  \n  40    |   0.052907   |   0.034597  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 40 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2325.1s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028415\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.028415\nTraining time:\
