    \ 'ssm_init_hidden_size': 64, 'ssm_increment_hidden_size': 64}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.064099   |   0.029677  \n   2    |   0.058240   |   0.029475  \n   3    |   0.058010   |   0.029379  \n   4    |   0.057846   |   0.029364  \n   5    |   0.057714   |   0.029578  \n   6    |   0.057628   |   0.029327  \n   7    |   0.057523   |   0.029326  \n   8    |   0.057371   |   0.030170  \n   9    |   0.057120   |   0.029070  \n  10    |   0.056757   |   0.033801  \n  11    |   0.056446   |   0.028833  \n  12    |   0.056178   |   0.031528  \n  13    |   0.055942   |   0.029210  \n  14    |   0.055788   |   0.028520  \n  15    |   0.055590   |   0.030616  \n  16    |   0.055371   |   0.028468\
    \  \n  17    |   0.055287   |   0.033381  \n  18    |   0.055204   |   0.037138  \n  19    |   0.055109   |   0.031170  \n  20    |   0.054986   |   0.029383  \n  21    |   0.054948   |   0.039903  \n  22    |   0.054761   |   0.028798  \n  23    |   0.054652   |   0.037875  \n  24    |   0.054599   |   0.029061  \n  25    |   0.054497   |   0.028916  \n  26    |   0.054411   |   0.030963  \n  27    |   0.054386   |   0.030455  \n  28    |   0.054299   |   0.029543  \n  29    |   0.054226   |   0.029429  \n  30    |   0.054091   |   0.029092  \n  31    |   0.054086   |   0.029624  \n  32    |   0.053868   |   0.029051  \n  33    |   0.053990   |   0.029333  \n  34    |   0.053763   |   0.030317  \n  35    |   0.053639   |   0.032967  \n  36    |   0.053599   |   0.029715  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 36 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2006.6s\nBest validation MAE: 0.028468\n\nTrial 2 completed:\n\
    Validation MAE: 0.028468\nTraining time: 2019s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: bd1ec4a5-6958-457d-ad74-8a95dcab91d5\nTotal time: 2737s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 20:57:08,380\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761310628380861221\n2025-10-24 20:57:08,414\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761310628414271026\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `update 45` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `update 39` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '45' updated.\n- Item '39' updated.\n-\
