    \ Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Eval ID 218 Corrected) | Veritas I | Tick 112 | 223 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 40 | Research Plan: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Eval ID 218) | Veritas I | Tick 111 | 275 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | Research Plan: Ablation-Out Study from SOTA (Eval ID 198) | Veritas I | Tick 110 | 122 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate (Eval ID 205) | Veritas I | Tick 105 | 359 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 34 | Research Plan: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature Loss (Eval ID 198) | Veritas I | Tick 103 | 353 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
